(6164427, 909122, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed: the small portion of water gives the sky an expansive feel. I''m sure other have said this, but it feels like the horizon is a bit off from level.</td>', 'Nicely composed: the small portion of water gives the sky an expansive feel. I''m sure other have said this, but it feels like the horizon is a bit off from level.', '2010-09-16 23:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164428, 907668, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo for this challenge! Nice job with the framing and depth of field.</td>', 'Excellent photo for this challenge! Nice job with the framing and depth of field.', '2010-09-16 23:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164430, 908017, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice work finding the single bit of colors in this field. It''s especially cool how this flower is not only the last standing, but also feels like it is standing strong in heavy wind.</td>', 'Nice work finding the single bit of colors in this field. It''s especially cool how this flower is not only the last standing, but also feels like it is standing strong in heavy wind.', '2010-09-16 23:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164433, 909226, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo, even without sharp focus and the large amount of noise I like how the edge of the sun shows some of the gas explosions that make up the sun.</td>', 'This is a cool photo, even without sharp focus and the large amount of noise I like how the edge of the sun shows some of the gas explosions that make up the sun.', '2010-09-16 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164434, 908905, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''m trying to understand this photo. I''m thinking the color of the wall is like that of the sun, and the clouds in the background may indicate rain. If so, I like your creativity and how you look at the world different than most.</td>', 'Hmmm, I''m trying to understand this photo. I''m thinking the color of the wall is like that of the sun, and the clouds in the background may indicate rain. If so, I like your creativity and how you look at the world different than most.', '2010-09-16 23:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164435, 908241, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a high key look. Gives the photo a bit more of an artistic feel.</td>', 'Nice use of a high key look. Gives the photo a bit more of an artistic feel.', '2010-09-16 23:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164598, 909156, 27133, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty.  The delicate pink of the petals and the dewdrops.  The fragility of life.</td>', 'This is so pretty.  The delicate pink of the petals and the dewdrops.  The fragility of life.', '2010-09-17 09:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164601, 909179, 27133, '<td valign="top">The uniqueness of every soul reminds us that we all have a reason for being here.</td>', 'The uniqueness of every soul reminds us that we all have a reason for being here.', '2010-09-17 09:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164602, 908915, 27133, '<td valign="top">The splitting of the rays forcing their way out of the cloud, wanting to be seen by all.  Showing us, that we too can fight our way through the darkness and out into the light.</td>', 'The splitting of the rays forcing their way out of the cloud, wanting to be seen by all.  Showing us, that we too can fight our way through the darkness and out into the light.', '2010-09-17 09:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164609, 908694, 27133, '<td valign="top">There is beauty no mattr where you look.  I need to look around me more.  Thankyou for showing me.</td>', 'There is beauty no mattr where you look.  I need to look around me more.  Thankyou for showing me.', '2010-09-17 09:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164610, 908865, 27133, '<td valign="top">I feel like I am in the fog int he backgound and fthe rainbow is showing me the way.</td>', 'I feel like I am in the fog int he backgound and fthe rainbow is showing me the way.', '2010-09-17 09:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164613, 909279, 27133, '<td valign="top">I love reds and yellows in images and you have captured that for me.</td>', 'I love reds and yellows in images and you have captured that for me.', '2010-09-17 09:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164615, 909277, 27133, '<td valign="top">The sun rising on a new day with new hope or setting on the sadness of the day past.  Hope is always ahead of us.</td>', 'The sun rising on a new day with new hope or setting on the sadness of the day past.  Hope is always ahead of us.', '2010-09-17 09:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164619, 909226, 27133, '<td valign="top">A new sun giving hope for a new day.  The orange of the sky is vibrant so all can see the promise ahead.</td>', 'A new sun giving hope for a new day.  The orange of the sky is vibrant so all can see the promise ahead.', '2010-09-17 09:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164620, 909293, 27133, '<td valign="top">I am not religious but buildings like this fascinate me.  They ahve so much characyter unlike the buildings of today.  And the old buildings stand the test of time and still attract the same if not more attention because of their uniqueness.  Ther is happiness after the sadness.</td>', 'I am not religious but buildings like this fascinate me.  They ahve so much characyter unlike the buildings of today.  And the old buildings stand the test of time and still attract the same if not more attention because of their uniqueness.  Ther is happiness after the sadness.', '2010-09-17 09:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164622, 909185, 27133, '<td valign="top">A lock normally ties two things together.  I dont remember seeing locks this way beofre.  But I see it as showing that a person is locked within their lives and they need to unlock their lives to be able to see and love life around them.</td>', 'A lock normally ties two things together.  I dont remember seeing locks this way beofre.  But I see it as showing that a person is locked within their lives and they need to unlock their lives to be able to see and love life around them.', '2010-09-17 09:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164623, 909194, 27133, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the vastness around here.  I only wish I could go and see it again.  I am trapped within my house.  Weeks ago I was trapped within myself...but now I have improved they have trapped me and I can''t escape to see the openness where I used to spend many hours of the day.  I miss that.  Thankyou for bringing it to me.</td>', 'This reminds me of the vastness around here.  I only wish I could go and see it again.  I am trapped within my house.  Weeks ago I was trapped within myself...but now I have improved they have trapped me and I can''t escape to see the openness where I used to spend many hours of the day.  I miss that.  Thankyou for bringing it to me.', '2010-09-17 09:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164624, 908713, 27133, '<td valign="top">Oh how I wish I could jump and splash in the water with the whale...to feel the freedom and beauty of such creatures would be amazing.</td>', 'Oh how I wish I could jump and splash in the water with the whale...to feel the freedom and beauty of such creatures would be amazing.', '2010-09-17 09:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164625, 909130, 27133, '<td valign="top">WOW....I like this.  Normally one would shoot from outside the glass.  But you have used the glass to show a transparent barrier that we all have around us.  Some break that barrier...others never do.</td>', 'WOW....I like this.  Normally one would shoot from outside the glass.  But you have used the glass to show a transparent barrier that we all have around us.  Some break that barrier...others never do.', '2010-09-17 09:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164630, 909167, 27133, '<td valign="top">As one life ends another starts.  But you must try to live that life to its best....the seeds that result will prosper even more.</td>', 'As one life ends another starts.  But you must try to live that life to its best....the seeds that result will prosper even more.', '2010-09-17 09:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164634, 908126, 27133, '<td valign="top">Everyone needs a rock in their life to keep them stable through hard times.  And as the cloud lifts the light will shine over that rock and warm the cold that surrounded the dark times.</td>', 'Everyone needs a rock in their life to keep them stable through hard times.  And as the cloud lifts the light will shine over that rock and warm the cold that surrounded the dark times.', '2010-09-17 09:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164635, 908907, 27133, '<td valign="top">A little ones has the ability to show great hope for all around them.</td>', 'A little ones has the ability to show great hope for all around them.', '2010-09-17 09:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164637, 906329, 27133, '<td valign="top">A jetty that once felt the heavy footsteps as people meandered out to the end through their sadness and the light footsteps of the lovers that enjoyed that moment together.  As time has passed the surface has gone but the memories stay strong within its supports.  The rays spread across the the horizon inviting others to test the magic of the jetty as others once did...!</td>', 'A jetty that once felt the heavy footsteps as people meandered out to the end through their sadness and the light footsteps of the lovers that enjoyed that moment together.  As time has passed the surface has gone but the memories stay strong within its supports.  The rays spread across the the horizon inviting others to test the magic of the jetty as others once did...!', '2010-09-17 09:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164638, 908225, 27133, '<td valign="top">I really like how the flowers are in colour showing there is life no matter how much sadness there is around us.</td>', 'I really like how the flowers are in colour showing there is life no matter how much sadness there is around us.', '2010-09-17 09:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164639, 909060, 27133, '<td valign="top">The magic of the light on the trees, as the wind does its best to blow its leaves away...does not hinder the power of the rainbow as it spreads it colour to give the trees hope in such a storm.</td>', 'The magic of the light on the trees, as the wind does its best to blow its leaves away...does not hinder the power of the rainbow as it spreads it colour to give the trees hope in such a storm.', '2010-09-17 09:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164640, 908264, 27133, '<td valign="top">That bench is so inviting but to me it appears the bench has itself come alive and has taken to enjoying the view for itself.  The beauty of the scene weaves its magic across even the inanimate objects to show the power of hope for all.</td>', 'That bench is so inviting but to me it appears the bench has itself come alive and has taken to enjoying the view for itself.  The beauty of the scene weaves its magic across even the inanimate objects to show the power of hope for all.', '2010-09-17 09:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164644, 909037, 27133, '<td valign="top">A fire goes through the land and devastates everything in its pass.  But you know what...after a fire....out of no where....comes small blades of grass and new leaves on trees....the animals return...and people follow.  Even after such a disaster, there is hope and new life.</td>', 'A fire goes through the land and devastates everything in its pass.  But you know what...after a fire....out of no where....comes small blades of grass and new leaves on trees....the animals return...and people follow.  Even after such a disaster, there is hope and new life.', '2010-09-17 09:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6164645, 909154, 27133, '<td valign="top">As two people take a moment out of their life to enjoy the day, little do they know how vast the world is around them and how small they really are in comparison.  But that same vastness also gives them hope for all parts of their life.  Nature is amazing in every way.</td>', 'As two people take a moment out of their life to enjoy the day, little do they know how vast the world is around them and how small they really are in comparison.  But that same vastness also gives them hope for all parts of their life.  Nature is amazing in every way.', '2010-09-17 09:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
