(6165115, 908100, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you had for this shot, it just need a few things to be better: Candy should be bright, so you may want to try adding some more soft (diffused light). Also, a bit of extra clarity in the focus area would be nice.</td>', 'I like the idea you had for this shot, it just need a few things to be better: Candy should be bright, so you may want to try adding some more soft (diffused light). Also, a bit of extra clarity in the focus area would be nice.', '2010-09-17 22:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165117, 907740, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m surprised the Zambezi was calm for a sunset this time of year. Nice composition, although I would have liked to see even more sun reflection in the water. Also, I was just there, so I know how colorful these sunsets are, but you really have to increase the overall saturation of the photo to bring it out.</td>', 'Wow, I''m surprised the Zambezi was calm for a sunset this time of year. Nice composition, although I would have liked to see even more sun reflection in the water. Also, I was just there, so I know how colorful these sunsets are, but you really have to increase the overall saturation of the photo to bring it out.', '2010-09-17 22:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
