(6165802, 909074, 63812, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2010-09-19 07:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165806, 907982, 27133, '<td valign="top">The simple things in life can often teach you the most about what is important in life.  Sunflowers grow in my area and always fascinate me when I see the enormous paddocks of flowers.  And there is always one that rises way above the rest.</td>', 'The simple things in life can often teach you the most about what is important in life.  Sunflowers grow in my area and always fascinate me when I see the enormous paddocks of flowers.  And there is always one that rises way above the rest.', '2010-09-19 07:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165807, 907477, 27133, '<td valign="top">A child can bring so much joy to ones life.</td>', 'A child can bring so much joy to ones life.', '2010-09-19 07:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165809, 909040, 27133, '<td valign="top">As darkness settles over daily life, the sun always shows itself one last time to remind us of what was and what will be.</td>', 'As darkness settles over daily life, the sun always shows itself one last time to remind us of what was and what will be.', '2010-09-19 07:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165810, 908732, 27133, '<td valign="top">As leaves wither and die, nearby there will always be new life beginning.  Only to remind us that no matter how bad things are, things can always get better.</td>', 'As leaves wither and die, nearby there will always be new life beginning.  Only to remind us that no matter how bad things are, things can always get better.', '2010-09-19 07:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165811, 908241, 27133, '<td valign="top">The shines over flowers, never the same way twice.  This image reminds of a painting....natures painting.</td>', 'The shines over flowers, never the same way twice.  This image reminds of a painting....natures painting.', '2010-09-19 07:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165813, 909298, 27133, '<td valign="top">The crispness of this image is amazing.  The splitting of the sun rays, whilst soft, takes over the power of this image and shows that no matter how things seem to matter in life...the things we often overlook matter the most.</td>', 'The crispness of this image is amazing.  The splitting of the sun rays, whilst soft, takes over the power of this image and shows that no matter how things seem to matter in life...the things we often overlook matter the most.', '2010-09-19 07:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165815, 908340, 27133, '<td valign="top">The delicate colours and shapes of these flowers remind me to look beyond the obvious to see the beauty of what is around me.</td>', 'The delicate colours and shapes of these flowers remind me to look beyond the obvious to see the beauty of what is around me.', '2010-09-19 07:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165816, 908644, 27133, '<td valign="top">Wow...this is so simple...let so appealing.  The wet layer over natures basics really draws me in and the simple border gives this image a professional finish that would do well on any wall.</td>', 'Wow...this is so simple...let so appealing.  The wet layer over natures basics really draws me in and the simple border gives this image a professional finish that would do well on any wall.', '2010-09-19 07:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165817, 909205, 27133, '<td valign="top">7am and the morning is jsut starting.  Time ticks on without stopping, oblivious to the dramas below.  We should follow this method...be oblivious to lifes dramas and just get on with life.</td>', '7am and the morning is jsut starting.  Time ticks on without stopping, oblivious to the dramas below.  We should follow this method...be oblivious to lifes dramas and just get on with life.', '2010-09-19 07:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165818, 909074, 27133, '<td valign="top">Amazing and stunning...the power of the sun forcing its way through the threatening clouds.  Life has a way of breaking through, no matter what is in its path.</td>', 'Amazing and stunning...the power of the sun forcing its way through the threatening clouds.  Life has a way of breaking through, no matter what is in its path.', '2010-09-19 07:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165819, 908494, 27133, '<td valign="top">A tiny droplet filled with magic.  Irrelevant to many, but life giving to others.</td>', 'A tiny droplet filled with magic.  Irrelevant to many, but life giving to others.', '2010-09-19 07:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165824, 908515, 27133, '<td valign="top">Some people would see a fly....carrying germs for one person to another.  What they don''t stop to see a the beautiful colours, the delicate droplets of water, the intricacy of lace work upon their leaves.  Beauty is everywhere...you just need to open your mind to see it.</td>', 'Some people would see a fly....carrying germs for one person to another.  What they don''t stop to see a the beautiful colours, the delicate droplets of water, the intricacy of lace work upon their leaves.  Beauty is everywhere...you just need to open your mind to see it.', '2010-09-19 09:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165825, 909126, 27133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful candy like colours are such fun.  Like fairy floss...the fun of the circus are what everyone sees.....memories of fun times help you the dark times.</td>', 'Beautiful candy like colours are such fun.  Like fairy floss...the fun of the circus are what everyone sees.....memories of fun times help you the dark times.', '2010-09-19 09:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
