(6166317, 909233, 27133, '<td valign="top">People travel around in their everyday duties, sometimes oblivious to the magic of the sky.  Thankyou for stopping and capturing it for me.</td>', 'People travel around in their everyday duties, sometimes oblivious to the magic of the sky.  Thankyou for stopping and capturing it for me.', '2010-09-19 19:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6166321, 909301, 27133, '<td valign="top">I have gone through many hours of worry....worry for my future, worry for my kids future, worry for my husbands future.  But I have fought and didn''t give up, although there were times when I wanted to.  I saw many rays of light as we travelled hours to and from medical appointments.  But couldn''t stop to capture them.  You have for me...thankyou.</td>', 'I have gone through many hours of worry....worry for my future, worry for my kids future, worry for my husbands future.  But I have fought and didn''t give up, although there were times when I wanted to.  I saw many rays of light as we travelled hours to and from medical appointments.  But couldn''t stop to capture them.  You have for me...thankyou.', '2010-09-19 19:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6166323, 908888, 27133, '<td valign="top">This is very spiritual.  No matter our race or culture...we need strength and belief.  It guides us through.</td>', 'This is very spiritual.  No matter our race or culture...we need strength and belief.  It guides us through.', '2010-09-19 19:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
