(6166589, 908738, 27133, '<td valign="top">Amazing....such strong colours and the way the light shines on them...wow.  You have captured an incredible scene...one to be proud of.</td>', 'Amazing....such strong colours and the way the light shines on them...wow.  You have captured an incredible scene...one to be proud of.', '2010-09-20 00:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
