(6166804, 908738, 61552, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess there''s a first for everything!  Thank you everyone!  Wow!  Yeah, this shot was from over the perimeter fence at Burning Man, at the airport after a rain storm.  I''ve learned that if I can impress William88, the photo will do well!  I thought it was too grainy, and I almost swapped it out for a sunrise shot.  It would have done well, too, but not in this competition.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-20 01:25:47.</i></td>', 'Well, I guess there''s a first for everything!  Thank you everyone!  Wow!  Yeah, this shot was from over the perimeter fence at Burning Man, at the airport after a rain storm.  I''ve learned that if I can impress William88, the photo will do well!  I thought it was too grainy, and I almost swapped it out for a sunrise shot.  It would have done well, too, but not in this competition.', '2010-09-20 02:03:47.000000', '2010-09-20 02:25:47.000000', 0),
(6166813, 908738, 28742, '<td valign="top">You suck. ...at predicting your score. lol. Congrats! Great image, well deserved.</td>', 'You suck. ...at predicting your score. lol. Congrats! Great image, well deserved.', '2010-09-20 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
