(6167010, 909037, 86218, '<td valign="top">Baie geluk Amanda op ''n goeie plek hier. Ek is nou al sommer verlief op Patrys en hy is my gunsteling karakter hier op DPC.<br/> <br/>A picture that really shows the aftermath of this fire and although I was there much later...It''s really sad to see the damages this has done. The Dog''s colours blends well with the scene and the smoke with rising sun carries the message and mood even further.</td>', 'Baie geluk Amanda op ''n goeie plek hier. Ek is nou al sommer verlief op Patrys en hy is my gunsteling karakter hier op DPC. A picture that really shows the aftermath of this fire and although I was there much later...It''s really sad to see the damages this has done. The Dog''s colours blends well with the scene and the smoke with rising sun carries the message and mood even further.', '2010-09-20 09:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
