(6167229, 907582, 100831, '<td valign="top">really nice, Lydia. Love the colors and the pretty bokeh - very joyous!</td>', 'really nice, Lydia. Love the colors and the pretty bokeh - very joyous!', '2010-09-20 13:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6167240, 908738, 61552, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by paqman:</b></div><hr/><i> What does it mean? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Double means there''s two of something.<br/> <br/>A Rainbow is an optical and meteorological phenomenon that causes a spectrum of light to appear in the sky when the Sun shines onto droplets of moisture in the Earth''s atmosphere. The overall effect is that the incoming light is reflected back over a wide range of angles, with the most intense light at an angle of 4042°.<br/> <br/>Playa, also known as an alkali flat or sabkha, a desert basin with no outlet which periodically fills with water to form a temporary lake.  Burning Man is a party of 50,000 people on a dry lake bed (playa)100 miles north of Reno, where I participate every year now, and is where I took this photo.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps.</td>', 'Originally posted by paqman: What does it mean?   Double means there''s two of something. A Rainbow is an optical and meteorological phenomenon that causes a spectrum of light to appear in the sky when the Sun shines onto droplets of moisture in the Earth''s atmosphere. The overall effect is that the incoming light is reflected back over a wide range of angles, with the most intense light at an angle of 4042°. Playa, also known as an alkali flat or sabkha, a desert basin with no outlet which periodically fills with water to form a temporary lake.  Burning Man is a party of 50,000 people on a dry lake bed (playa)100 miles north of Reno, where I participate every year now, and is where I took this photo. I hope this helps.', '2010-09-20 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 0),
